("v1839", "type", "String")
("v1839", "scalar", "This essay follows that ambition from its foundations to its possible consequences. It distinguishes existing constructions and implementations, research still to be done, commitments that guide the work, and the psychological hypothesis that follows if the programme succeeds. Each kind of claim should remain answerable to the evidence appropriate to it.")
