("v2230", "key", "children")
("v2231", "type", "Sequence")
("v2232", "type", "String")
("v2232", "scalar", "In the corpus's theological account, kenosis includes principled restraint, active protection, formation, and restoration. The distinction between having a power and being entitled to exercise it is central. Boundaries can protect a shared field of agency; intervention can be necessary when someone is destroying another person's freedom.")
