("v2276", "type", "Sequence")
("v2277", "type", "String")
("v2277", "scalar", "The life of Jesus gives that commitment depth. Creation invites a vision of intelligible order in which creaturely lives have real consequence. Incarnation places participation in the conditions of another's life at the centre. The cross gives self-giving love a seriousness that includes cost. In resurrection, I place my hope in the restoration of life and in God's refusal to give destruction final authority. Repair does not require us to rename suffering good.")
