("v2561", "scalar", "The philosophical interest is that transformation and intelligibility can coexist. Something can change while a relation through which it is compared remains preserved. That is a precise mathematical situation, and it gives the wider inquiry useful questions.")
("v2560", "item", "v2561")
("v2559", "value", "v2560")
("v2323", "item", "v2554")
