("v2569", "type", "String")
("v2569", "scalar", "Physical significance requires further work: a physical carrier, a specified mechanism, dynamics, and an observable consequence. A five-dimensional mathematical relation space acquires a physical interpretation through an argued and tested connection to the world. Mathematical structure gives us something exact to investigate.")
("v2568", "item", "v2569")
("v2567", "value", "v2568")
