("v2577", "type", "String")
("v2577", "scalar", "The scientific programme also asks what observations discard. A proposed difference may become invisible when a measurement combines channels, averages a record, projects away structure, or fails to retain the information that distinguishes competing accounts. The Admissibility Frontier develops this concern through questions about composition, dynamics, selection, and detector records.")
