("v2606", "scalar", "The constructive ambition is to identify where a better calculation, measurement, or device can begin. Useful progress may include a sharper model, a new control method, a clearer theorem, or an experiment that distinguishes alternatives previously treated as equivalent.")
("v2605", "item", "v2606")
("v2604", "value", "v2605")
