("v2620", "key", "children")
("v2621", "type", "Sequence")
("v2622", "type", "String")
("v2622", "scalar", "Across the programme I keep returning to a question: what makes a shared order capable of sustaining real difference and consequential change? Mathematics makes particular versions of that question exact. Computing makes others executable. Theology asks what the exercise of power within such an order is for.")
("v2621", "item", "v2622")
("v2620", "value", "v2621")
("v2323", "item", "v2615")
