("v2997", "type", "String")
("v2997", "scalar", "Consider a collection of someone's knowledge, stories, questions, and discoveries. A world could give that material structure: identities, places, relationships, paths, encounters, and opportunities for participation. Different presentations could make different aspects accessible while retaining a connection to the underlying material.")
