("v3188", "type", "String")
("v3188", "scalar", "I spent months trying to keep an LLM's work within the platform. It could produce a plausible surface by going around the intended model. It could probe through another route. Once work was brought through the algebra, much of that problem became tractable. The compiler and build facilities then exposed another route around the intended discipline.")
