("v3345", "type", "String")
("v3345", "scalar", "I want the human and the agent to have distinct, enforceable places from which to act. The person should be able to author rules, grant capabilities, inspect consequences, and revise delegation. The agent should be able to contribute substantial work through the capabilities it has actually received.")
