("v3361", "type", "String")
("v3361", "scalar", "The goal is effective delegation. People should be able to grant enough freedom for useful work while retaining meaningful control over consequential changes. Completion includes making that arrangement hold through the host environment; the current algebraic authoring path is a step in that work.")
