("v3515", "scalar", "The programme algebra pursues that aim through typed objects and transformations. Its records carry distinctions such as assumptions, evidence, losses, context, and authority. A movement from one object or domain to another must preserve the conditions under which the movement is warranted. A link between scientific documents does not become a scientific transformation merely by existing.")
