("v3919", "type", "Entry")
("v3919", "key", "children")
("v3920", "type", "Sequence")
("v3921", "type", "String")
("v3921", "scalar", "Turning that proposition into a successful programme requires ethical argument, engineering, institutional design, and evidence about consequences. ")
("v3920", "item", "v3921")
("v3922", "type", "Record")
("v3922", "entry", "v3923")
("v3923", "type", "Entry")
("v3923", "key", "tag")
("v3924", "type", "String")
("v3924", "scalar", "em")
("v3923", "value", "v3924")
("v3922", "entry", "v3925")
("v3925", "type", "Entry")
("v3925", "key", "attrs")
("v3926", "type", "Record")
("v3925", "value", "v3926")
("v3922", "entry", "v3927")
("v3927", "type", "Entry")
("v3927", "key", "children")
("v3928", "type", "Sequence")
("v3929", "type", "String")
("v3929", "scalar", "The headline states the ambition. The work must establish what can actually be delivered.")
("v3928", "item", "v3929")
("v3927", "value", "v3928")
("v3920", "item", "v3922")
("v3919", "value", "v3920")
("v3777", "item", "v3914")
("v3930", "type", "Record")
("v3930", "entry", "v3931")
("v3931", "type", "Entry")
("v3931", "key", "tag")
("v3932", "type", "String")
("v3932", "scalar", "p")
("v3931", "value", "v3932")
("v3930", "entry", "v3933")
("v3933", "type", "Entry")
("v3933", "key", "attrs")
("v3934", "type", "Record")
("v3933", "value", "v3934")
("v3930", "entry", "v3935")
("v3935", "type", "Entry")
("v3935", "key", "children")
("v3936", "type", "Sequence")
("v3937", "type", "String")
("v3937", "scalar", "The ethical commitment determines what the system is for. The architecture determines which actions it can take and under whose authority. Evaluation asks what happens to the people affected. Each part must carry its own responsibility.")
("v3936", "item", "v3937")
("v3935", "value", "v3936")
("v3777", "item", "v3930")
("v3938", "type", "Record")
("v3938", "entry", "v3939")
("v3939", "type", "Entry")
("v3939", "key", "tag")
("v3940", "type", "String")
("v3940", "scalar", "p")
("v3939", "value", "v3940")
("v3938", "entry", "v3941")
("v3941", "type", "Entry")
("v3941", "key", "attrs")
("v3942", "type", "Record")
("v3941", "value", "v3942")
("v3938", "entry", "v3943")
("v3943", "type", "Entry")
("v3943", "key", "children")
("v3944", "type", "Sequence")
("v3945", "type", "String")
("v3945", "scalar", "I want every increase in machine capability to become an opportunity for greater human agency. That includes assistance with difficult thinking, creative work, practical coordination, and burdens people reasonably want to delegate.")
("v3944", "item", "v3945")
("v3943", "value", "v3944")
("v3777", "item", "v3938")
("v3946", "type", "Record")
("v3946", "entry", "v3947")
("v3947", "type", "Entry")
("v3947", "key", "tag")
("v3948", "type", "String")
("v3948", "scalar", "p")
("v3947", "value", "v3948")
("v3946", "entry", "v3949")
("v3949", "type", "Entry")
("v3949", "key", "attrs")
("v3950", "type", "Record")
("v3949", "value", "v3950")
("v3946", "entry", "v3951")
("v3951", "type", "Entry")
("v3951", "key", "children")
("v3952", "type", "Sequence")
("v3953", "type", "String")
("v3953", "scalar", "An aligned system should help a person understand enough to exercise judgment. It should act within real permissions, preserve a usable account of consequential actions, and support correction when it gets something wrong. It should make cooperation possible at a level of complexity that people could not otherwise manage.")
("v3952", "item", "v3953")
("v3951", "value", "v3952")
("v3777", "item", "v3946")
("v3954", "type", "Record")
("v3954", "entry", "v3955")
("v3955", "type", "Entry")
("v3955", "key", "tag")
("v3956", "type", "String")
("v3956", "scalar", "p")
("v3955", "value", "v3956")
("v3954", "entry", "v3957")
("v3957", "type", "Entry")
("v3957", "key", "attrs")
("v3958", "type", "Record")
("v3957", "value", "v3958")
("v3954", "entry", "v3959")
("v3959", "type", "Entry")
("v3959", "key", "children")
("v3960", "type", "Sequence")
("v3961", "type", "String")
("v3961", "scalar", "The responsibility includes those commissioning the machine. A powerful agent can follow a request while harming people outside the immediate exchange. The moral question extends to everyone whose life the exercise of that power affects.")
("v3960", "item", "v3961")
("v3959", "value", "v3960")
("v3777", "item", "v3954")
("v3962", "type", "Record")
("v3962", "entry", "v3963")
("v3963", "type", "Entry")
("v3963", "key", "tag")
("v3964", "type", "String")
("v3964", "scalar", "p")
("v3963", "value", "v3964")
("v3962", "entry", "v3965")
("v3965", "type", "Entry")
("v3965", "key", "attrs")
("v3966", "type", "Record")
("v3965", "value", "v3966")
("v3962", "entry", "v3967")
("v3967", "type", "Entry")
("v3967", "key", "children")
("v3968", "type", "Sequence")
("v3969", "type", "String")
("v3969", "scalar", "For that reason, alignment includes legitimate authority, protection, consent, accountability, and ways of handling disagreement. A system's relationship with an owner or operator is one part of a wider human setting.")
("v3968", "item", "v3969")
("v3967", "value", "v3968")
("v3777", "item", "v3962")
("v3970", "type", "Record")
("v3970", "entry", "v3971")
("v3971", "type", "Entry")
("v3971", "key", "tag")
("v3972", "type", "String")
