("v4855", "type", "String")
("v4855", "scalar", "The mechanism would be repeated experience. People understand something consequential, make a meaningful choice, contribute to a shared result, correct a mistake, and remain participants. The corpus gives that experience a vocabulary. Accessible practices give it a place in daily life.")
