("v4916", "type", "String")
("v4916", "scalar", "Consider a possible workshop in which people build a world from a community's stories. Participants contribute material, inspect how it is represented, question a connection, and revise an encounter. An agent helps with difficult implementation work. People retain an effective say in what the world communicates.")
("v4915", "item", "v4916")
("v4914", "value", "v4915")
