("v5112", "type", "String")
("v5112", "scalar", "Martela and Steger distinguish three dimensions of meaning in life: coherence, purpose, and significance. Coherence concerns comprehensibility; purpose concerns direction; significance concerns life's value. Their work supplies a conceptual framework for understanding these differences.")
