("v5197", "type", "String")
("v5197", "scalar", "The hoped-for psychological effect is a stronger relationship between what a person cares about and what they can actually do. Intellectual life, practical work, spiritual commitment, and concern for others could become more mutually intelligible.")
("v5196", "item", "v5197")
("v5195", "value", "v5196")
