("v5259", "key", "children")
("v5260", "type", "Sequence")
("v5261", "type", "String")
("v5261", "scalar", "Bandura's account of collective efficacy concerns shared belief in a group's ability to produce effects through coordinated action. His synthesis connects that belief with collective commitment, resilience, and accomplishment.")
