("v5288", "type", "Entry")
("v5288", "key", "children")
("v5289", "type", "Sequence")
("v5290", "type", "String")
("v5290", "scalar", "The programme's larger hypothesis is that successful participation could make effective cooperation feel more attainable.")
("v5289", "item", "v5290")
("v5288", "value", "v5289")
("v5206", "item", "v5283")
("v5291", "type", "Record")
("v5291", "entry", "v5292")
("v5292", "type", "Entry")
("v5292", "key", "tag")
("v5293", "type", "String")
("v5293", "scalar", "p")
("v5292", "value", "v5293")
("v5291", "entry", "v5294")
("v5294", "type", "Entry")
("v5294", "key", "attrs")
("v5295", "type", "Record")
("v5294", "value", "v5295")
("v5291", "entry", "v5296")
("v5296", "type", "Entry")
("v5296", "key", "children")
("v5297", "type", "Sequence")
("v5298", "type", "String")
("v5298", "scalar", "A community could acquire confidence through completing useful work together. That confidence would have a practical basis: people would know some of the methods, possess some of the tools, and understand something about how to handle disagreement.")
("v5297", "item", "v5298")
("v5296", "value", "v5297")
("v5206", "item", "v5291")
("v5299", "type", "Record")
("v5299", "entry", "v5300")
("v5300", "type", "Entry")
("v5300", "key", "tag")
("v5301", "type", "String")
("v5301", "scalar", "p")
("v5300", "value", "v5301")
("v5299", "entry", "v5302")
("v5302", "type", "Entry")
("v5302", "key", "attrs")
("v5303", "type", "Record")
("v5302", "value", "v5303")
("v5299", "entry", "v5304")
("v5304", "type", "Entry")
("v5304", "key", "children")
("v5305", "type", "Sequence")
("v5306", "type", "String")
("v5306", "scalar", "The effect could extend to expectations of leadership. Participants might increasingly expect a capable leader or system to explain its purposes, respect delegated authority, support correction, and develop other people's abilities.")
("v5305", "item", "v5306")
("v5304", "value", "v5305")
("v5206", "item", "v5299")
("v5307", "type", "Record")
("v5307", "entry", "v5308")
