("v5728", "scalar", "There will be different public responses. Some people may experience renewed religious confidence. Some may be drawn to the scientific or technical work. Others may care most about ownership, education, creative freedom, or help with a practical task. Sceptical participation may be as valuable as enthusiastic participation when it improves the work.")
