("v6242", "type", "Entry")
("v6242", "key", "children")
("v6243", "type", "Sequence")
("v6244", "type", "String")
("v6244", "scalar", "The same discipline applies across the undertaking. Technical success can give us a reliable tool. A mathematical result can give us a precise structure. A theological argument can articulate a reason for hope and action. Their connections should be evaluated through the work each connection actually enables.")
("v6243", "item", "v6244")
("v6242", "value", "v6243")
